 "about": "Signal classifier classes. id: stable key (model output, training truth). plugin: the decoder plugin folder (plugins/<id>) that decodes it, null = none. demod / bw_hz: the VFO click-to-tune sets up (demods kraken_doa has: NBFM, WBFM, AM, DIGITAL; null = none fits). occ_bw_hz: nominal occupied bandwidth range [lo, hi] (99 % power; the training truth's SNR bandwidth is clamped to it). burst: transmissions come and go (false: a continuous carrier when on air). fills_band: wider than the receiver's 2.4 MHz (seen as a band full of it). unknown: an open-set rejection family, never a real system. hidden: a class the model has but the page never shows (none = a detection that is no signal). merged_into: a class the model does not tell apart from that one in a 2.4 MHz view (its examples are trained as that class; the model has no output for it).",
